      "updated": 1777799833414,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Option A: Make the user wait until T1 is completed\n\nOption B: Allow the user to transact, show them the incorrect balance for now \nwhich eventually will rectified later on (via reconcilation)",
